# A required target field written only when an optional source field is present.
-- source.cue --
o?: int
-- target.cue --
o: int
-- lens.cue --
input: _
result: {if input.o != _|_ {o: input.o}}
-- out --
unknown
result.o is required by the target schema, and is written only under input.o != _|_, which the checker cannot show cover every instance; write it unconditionally, under a condition and its negation, or under type tests covering every alternative of the tested field (rule unknown-exhaustive) @ lens.cue:2:1
